# w69-perf (the operator, 2026-10-10: "the game has become a bit more laggy … i notice it mostly
# when draging cards around … i expect to get at least ~250fps at all times"). A mid-game board, so
# the per-frame cost of a drag is measured against a realistic number of cards: alice holds six
# cards and has nine permanents, bob holds four and has eight. Alice casts Eternal Witness off her
# Forests at the end; its trigger (Lightning Bolt in her graveyard to return) stays on the stack
# while bob (Full Control) holds priority, so its ability chip can be dragged.
turn=3
activeplayer=human
activephase=MAIN1
humanlife=17
ailife=14
humanhand=Eternal Witness;Grizzly Bears;Lightning Bolt;Counterspell;Island;Mountain
humanbattlefield=Forest;Forest;Forest;Forest;Island;Mountain;Llanowar Elves;Grizzly Bears;Memnite
humanlibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
humangraveyard=Lightning Bolt
aihand=Counterspell;Island;Shock;Grizzly Bears
aibattlefield=Island;Island;Island;Mountain;Mountain;Memnite;Grizzly Bears;Llanowar Elves
ailibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
aigraveyard=Shock
